# API base URL.
# - Unset (no .env / variable removed): defaults to https://snakeroom.fly.dev.
# - Set to a full origin (as below): the frontend calls that backend directly.
# - Set to an EMPTY value (VITE_API_URL=): uses the Vite dev proxy, which
#   forwards /api to the target in vite.config.ts (default http://localhost:8000).
#
# NOTE: copying this file to .env as-is makes the frontend call snakeroom.fly.dev
# directly (NOT the local backend via the dev proxy). For local backend dev,
# set VITE_API_URL= (empty) instead.
VITE_API_URL=https://snakeroom.fly.dev
